.Sh CAVEATS
Only 64-bit Linux, FreeBSD, and OpenBSD systems have been tested.
Support for other systems (such as macOS) is on a best-effort basis.
.Pp
Notable features still missing:
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
Soft Updates
.It
Sun/Solaris UFSv2 support
.It
Journaling
.It
Snapshots
.It
ACLs
.El
.Sh BUGS
This software is not yet ready for production use.
Write support in particular is experimental and may corrupt filesystems.
Please report issues at the project page linked above.
